Each choice will result in a different blessing from us.Long ago, the mountains of the Russet Highlands surged and boiled, and the earth trembled violently. The Aniimo clans that lived here faced catastrophe.
Then a Helmwhelp rushed to the summit and, enduring the searing agony that engulfed its body, swallowed a Flame Flower that bloomed brightly amid the raging inferno.
The mountains returned to peace, but the Helmwhelp’s body was scorched blood-red. From then on, it could breathe roaring flames, transforming into the legendary Infergon.Um, is that the part you’re focusing on...?Someone new! We haven’t met you before!Huh? Hey there! We’re in the middle of Synergy Training!100%Ancient Wire_Short (No Conductive Effect)Press #kHud/NormalAttack#z to replace skillsSalted Cherry BlossomTeam BonusMark my words, this little one’s going to be a star!The Doctor’s Research TopicEyebrows 7Pearl of the SeaWhere’s ShellyAuto-recycle 10 unused Aniipods.Epic BubblePick upTransport the Pathfinder to the specified coordinatesIncreases Damage Amp by <style=Hint_BgL><customRichText(calcData,buff, 2119404,param0,1,%d)>%</style> for <style=Hint_BgL><customRichText(buffConfigData,2119404,duration)></style>s.While in a sanctum, press #kHud/SkillQ#z to activate Grab. Move the reticle over an interactable object to aim, and grabbable objects will be highlighted. Use #kSkill/ZoomIn#z #kSkill/ZoomOut#z to adjust distance. Press #kSkill/PutItem#z to put the object down, or #kSkill/TossItem#z to throw it.Lumin Crystals x9,990Incredible HP PotentialDuring searches, the chance of encountering a <color=#e1a347><b>Perfect {0} </color></b>is increased by <color=#e1a347><b><size=204>{1}%</size></color></b>.Silent Owl SpiritReach RV level 15.You can <style=Hint_BgL>play the flute</style> via the Interaction Panel—perhaps a nearby Pathfinder will hear and respond to your melody!Great—we're classmates now! Come on, let's go find <style=Hint_BgD>Dr. Lewis</style>!Lush, velvety petals hiding a thorny romance.Speaking of which, there are some local books in this room. Maybe we can find something useful in them?UltimateFrontMy FollowsSee that strange Wisptis? Quick, get the camera!Panpanta RelicSummer Waves Pawprint RugChic, clean-cut, cool, and calm.Fire Damage Boost<color=#d89c28>Press 2</color> to switch your companion Aniimo to Skippy, then <color=#d89c28>press C</color