————
It turns out that the Bonesky and Emberpup families have been fighting each other for control of Beast Fang Ridge.
However, it’s not all hostile between them—some Boneskies and Emberpups are secretly friends.
It’s worth noting that Boneskies and Emberpups once coexisted peacefully and had a simple partnership—
Boneskies would create ice pillars, while Emberpups would melt them with fire to get fresh water in the caverns.
What’s more, stronger Emberpups would thaw the surface of the underground river with fire, whereas stronger Boneskies would absorb the biting cold air in the cave to prevent the Emberpups coming to fetch water from getting frostbite.
This partnership, however, has long become a thing of the past.In Command Mode, <color=#D89C28>hold [Q]</color> to use <color=#D89C28>Gravity Pull</color>. Press the <color=#D89C28>left mouse button</color> to lift a rock and smash it down on the target.FaceRed-Tiled Roof Ridge%s capabilityText 6 content placeholder content placeholder content placeholder content contentJourney HandbookPoison TP Reduction Bonus MultiplierSpinning Laser###Hold to continuously spin and ATK nearby targetsFlowers and ThornsPlateau EcologyBeachWhalesong BlossomCapture or defeat all targets: %s/%sOnly the Team Leader can use this.Twine with Cornet and approach another CornetHave you forgotten? Those guys who ambushed Lunara!
