By then, everyone will know who you are...Agile AniimoThe Legend of Mist and Light<color=#5090df>%s</color> has been working for a long time and needs a good rest!Open Aniimo on a Trip.Chirpi and Budclaw in this area will be friendly to you.Your changes will be resetUnique to Sea of Flowers. Send Aniimo to gather it near the RV Park in this area.Not enough storage space in Aniimo Management. Cannot catch the Alpha.Among the Budsquire family, Thornblades are guardians armed with unbreakable thorns.
To protect his little sister, one Budsquire brother became a mighty Thornblade. He challenged one famed Lethal Thorn after another, making the same pact each time: the loser would break off their own thorn.
But no Thornblade wins forever.
After his thorn was broken, he could not bear to be comforted by his sister, much less protected by her. So he ventured into a thunderstorm, hoping to become a stronger Thunderstorm Thornblade.
He failed.
After losing her brother, the little sister was no longer the innocent flower she once was. When her tears finally ran dry, she began her own training.
On a stormy night, she bloomed into a flower of grief, with thorns as cold and merciless as her pain.
Since then, she has cut down every challenger without hesitation, breaking their thorns without mercy.
Perhaps because that same cruel ritual took her brother from her. Perhaps because she despises the duels themselves.
Or perhaps she is still waiting for someone strong enough to defeat her—to take the Pale Thorn from her, and with it, finally set her free.Learn passive talent [Magic Horn].It’s Fentufts’ mission to help all those in sorrow and bring smiles back to their faces!Sparkling EggSquare Wooden Post...That Stellarys seems really happy.GatherYou’re already in the target worldBefore it left, it told us it’d probably check around the <style=Hint_BgD>Big Grumpbear’s territory</style>. You could go look for the egg there. That bear’s enormous, so watch out!Psst! #playerName#, over here!Alpha GeodebackIt's said that lucky clovers representing good fortune are hidden in these ruins...We’re celebrating! Join us!Owlish EleganceYou’ve gotta grow up a bit before you can do that...Glintstone ShardActivity EXP Gift PackExclusive resonance material for the Flutternym family.It’s like we’re covering this new land in flowers.Shield of TenacityRestless BoneskyTo the Thornblade guards, Princess Melloblum is the fairest blossom of their lineage, a treasure demanding meticulous protection. While all revere her, the First Lethal Thorn recognizes that this attention suffocates her. Yet these Thornblades, who wear their duty as honor, never pause to consider Melloblum’s own desires.Left Lane LeaderboardYou’ve unlocked a brand-new plot of land. Time to make your mark!I’m ready. Let’s start!Stamina-required Tumbler (Placeholder)Where’s the most beautiful place around here?I can feel it. The vein has regained its vitality.Complete the prerequisite research topic to unlock.My best friend is one of them. It suddenly turned blacker and blacker, and got really cranky. It took me some effort to calm it down... Place 4 Mines in your Home.Plan 1Grey and brown stone, fundamental and necessary material for constructions.I’m not making a face. I’m checking the temperature!#playerName#!Thanks for taking care of them. My Grass-type Aniimo are looking much perkier!Nine-Grid Floor - Milk GrayA cane made of gold a