I heard it got that color from soaking up too much sun.REGEN AuraDefeat target using Cozite Nest Sentry."1. During the event, you can get Sparks through the following ways:
 · Complete the Fire Companion Codex quest.
 · Take part in the Continuing Sparks mode.
 · Check in at the Sparkelf statue in Horizon Square (only once per day).
 2. Continuing Sparks mode details:
 · Each day, interact with friends to light up Sparks. Interactions include:
 ※ Chat: send messages to each other.
 ※ Party Up: form a team.
 ※ Gift: send gifts to each other.
 ※ Aniimo Exchange: exchange Aniimo.
 ※ Visit Home: visit each other.
 · After you light up a Spark, a Spark icon will appear next to your friend’s nickname. The number next to it shows how many days you and that friend have interacted during the event. Once you hit 5 days or more, the Spark icon will also level up.
 · The Spark icon will gray out after the daily server refresh at 04:00. Interact with your friends to light it up again.
 3. Event rewards:
 · When your personal total number of Sparks reaches the required amount, you can claim personal progress rewards.
 · When the server-wide total number of Sparks reaches the required amount, all players can claim server-wide progress rewards.
 · Special Notes:
 ※ The Sparkelf with the <style=Hint_BgL>Sparkling Mutation</style> (including the Basic Form and Prismana Form) has a sparkling outline effect, but no partial recolor effect.
 ※ The Sparkelf (Prismana Form) will be unavailable after the event ends. Please stay tuned for future official announcements."Mini world-class... "GoGoHomes"? Sounds fancy, is there anything special about it?Complete Sanctum: Spread Your WingsCurls into a ball and spins with a blade sticking out, dealing Physical damage.Error MessageYou uncover the truth behind the Blitz Tree phone calls: a Bolty grandfather and his grandchild have been hiding inside the hollow trunk, pretending to be the departed Bolties everyone is trying to reach in the sky. The young Bolty has only just taken over from her grandfather and is still learning the ropes. The old Bolty asks you to keep their secret, while the young one asks you to help her practice by role-playing several different Bolties on the other end of the line.It just keeps moving to the beat—it can’t stop!Whoo... Xing, work hard to Evolve! Next time we meet, I'll be a new knight!Lightweight and breathable with stylish design, a must-have for home and travel!That’s what an older Whelpy should do. But it would be nice if another Whelpy could help me at <color=#ffe451>night</color>.I didn’t know he was trapped in the ice... or that he became a Ghost Glynsera.You’re such a nice Bolty! Can I ask your name?Ambitious Chirpi practices its whistling somewhere quiet, determined to amaze everyone one day.It’s exquisite! I can die happy now!That’s how the Russet Highlands got its name... but as you can tell, this isn’t a peaceful place.MagnetiteAniimo can’t tell time, but they love balloons dancing in the warm wind, are fascinated by the tunes from a record player, and could watch products slowly drying behind glass all day.(What was I doing?)Strawberry SeedPlot 16Extremely HighFeathered BloomvilleReach 8,500 Habitability.Featherblade WaltzPippiMaybe I’ll find out I still love perfumery... but maybe... I could become a painter instead!Increases the BREAK damage of the Ultimate by <style=Hint_BgL><customRichText(calcData,buff, 2010000,p