Your name’s all over the Institute’s reports and thank-you letters.Select MakeupLemon Tree Seed1. According to the Academy's observations, Vein energy has recently become unusually active in certain Areas, causing special changes in the local ecology.
2. During the Event, for the first 3 "Nurture Ecology" attempts each weekend in the currently designated Area, the Chance of Nova Stage Aniimo appearing will be greatly increased. After harvesting Veinfruit, the amount of Area Prismatic energy gained will also receive an additional 50% boost.
"Nurture Ecology" increases the current region's Prismatic energy. When Catching Aniimo, there is also a Chance to trigger a Lucky Strike, increasing the region's Prismatic energy.
·Each time "Nurture Ecology" increases the region's Prismatic energy, there is a 3% Chance to trigger a Prismana Flow, Bonding a local Prismana Form Aniimo to appear.
·Each time Catching Aniimo triggers a "Lucky Strike" and increases the region's Prismatic energy, there is a 0.6% Chance to trigger a Prismana Flow, Bonding a local Prismana Form Aniimo to appear.
3. Each weekend, the abundant Vein energy will also Bond large numbers of Aniimo to gather in the currently designated Area, where Pathfinders can head out to explore and Catch them.
4. During the Event, some special Prismana Form Aniimo will also be drawn by Vein energy to appear for a limited time in designated Areas. For the Prismana Forms appearing in each phase and their corresponding Areas, please refer to the Event preview below.
