An ATK Amplifier Chip with a lighting Skill that greatly expands your field of view in the Lost Sanctum.For those who have traveled far from home, the moment they see the hills covered in duskwhispers, they know home lies just ahead.Don’t look at me like that! I’m too old for whatever you’re thinking!A feast for every sense begins beneath the night sky!While in a Sanctum, press the Skill button to activate Grab. Move the reticle over an interactable object to aim, and grabbable objects will be highlighted. Use the buttons to adjust distance. Press [Drop] to put the object down and press [Toss] to throw it.Season Keepsakes PackThe young Recas and the young Icho were once the greatest rivals on Beast Fang Ridge, each convinced that defeating the other would make him the strongest. One day, the Recas discovered an ice crystal deep within a cavern and sought to break it free. the Icho opposed him, believing it would collapse the cavern and endanger both the Bonesky clan below and the Emberpups above. They clashed—and in the aftermath, the cave gave way, burying the Recas beneath the ice. The Icho lost his rival. Yet unknown to all, the Recas survived, trapped in a narrow crevice. In darkness and solitude, resentment took root, twisting him into the Ghost Glynsera. When he finally shattered the ice in a frenzy and broke free, the Icho was gone, and the Boneskies had already chosen a new Recas. From then on, he became a wandering wraith of resentment in the night, and under his influence, some Boneskies too began to harbor shadows in their hearts.The Irisal-inspired collection was a huge hit. We must restock materials.I heard a huge thunder and went hiding into a bush...Morphi! Morphi!
