And if the scent fades, they’ll fly off.Undying dragon-breath, and an extraordinary, crushing presence.Today’s DealsMovement Speed BoostWhen Alpha Irisal was still just a giant bloom, it once crossed paths with Lady Irelia—gliding effortlessly upon the wind. Yet the bloom sensed something amiss: Lady Irelia wasn’t truly free. Unsure how to help, it turned to its dear friend Old Clovis for guidance and asked him to craft a seed brimming with extraordinary life force, one that might aid Lady Irelia. Drawing on his innate sensitivity to life itself, Old Clove distilled the essence of all six Iris forms into a single seed—imbuing it with immense vitality. But perhaps something vital was still missing—while the Life Force Seed succeeded in transforming the giant bloom into the Alpha Irisal, it brought no relief to Lady Irelia. In his final moments, Old Clovis lay on his deathbed when Irisal came to bid him farewell, placing the seed gently into his palm, hoping his life might yet begin anew.Battle the Blazen Alpha and make it enter Burst State.Aniimo and their skills have <style=Hint_BgL>elemental differences</style> that create <style=Hint_BgL>counters</style>. Use them wisely to deal more damage.Umbrabow AniimoCompanion Handbook EXP AddedJust aim to be as tough as the big guy at the springs!Own 1 Sparkling Prismana Panpanta.You’ve reached the order limit, so you can’t accept any new orders.I'll be careful.Press Power Module.Plant Charge—Tower ClimbSpaceThe core of the artificial intelligence consciousness, Aimo.Rainy<sprite name="UI_Img_Weather_Rainy"> or Thunderstorm<sprite name="UI_Img_Weather_Thunderstorm">We're not taking the treasure, just going in for Field Notes...
