The venue for the gathering is newly cleared, so there’s still a fair amount of clutter. We’ll need to tidy it up first.It’s been everywhere... met all kinds of Bolties... so it’d see right through my little lies.1. During the event, Pathfinders can pick one Prismana Aniimo they like on the event screen. Once your title is promoted to Junior Wayfarer, you can claim the Aniimo you picked. You can change your selection at any time before claiming.
2. The Aniimo you claim will be in Prismana Form, with a randomly generated personality. After you claim it, Phase 2 Prismana Pact will unlock.
3. After Prismana Pact unlocks, Pathfinders can continue collecting Prismana Aniimo within the event’s designated scope. Each time you register a new Prismana Aniimo, it will increase the corresponding Prismana Index completion progress.
4. If the Prismana Aniimo you claimed in Phase 1 is within the Prismana Pact Index scope, it will also count toward your completion progress. Getting the same Prismana Aniimo more than once will not increase progress again.
5. When your Prismana Index completion reaches the required milestones, you can claim the corresponding stage rewards.
6. You can check your current Prismana Aniimo registrations through View Index on the event screen, and keep hunting for Prismana Aniimo you haven’t registered yet.Very introvertedMutated rare cranberry, enveloped in a rainbow-like glow.Why does the moon disappear when the sun comes out?NaverObtained by processing materials at the <style=Hint_BgL>Dance Pad Polisher</style> in your HomeWe’re leaving already...?
