EndedHeld Item Function Description Test 31. According to the Academy's observations, Vein energy has recently become unusually active in certain Areas, causing special changes in the local ecosystem.
2. During the Event, the appearance Chance of Nova Stage Aniimo will be greatly increased in the first 3 "Nurture Ecology" attempts made each weekend in the currently designated Area. After harvesting Veinfruit, the amount of Area Prismatic energy gained will also receive an additional 50% increase.
"Nurture Ecology" can increase the current region's Prismatic energy. When Catching Aniimo, there is also a Chance to trigger a Lucky Strike, which increases the region's Prismatic energy.
·Each time the region's Prismatic energy increases through "Nurture Ecology," there is a 3% Chance to trigger a Prismana Flow, Bonding a Prismana Form Aniimo to appear in this region.
·Each time Catching Aniimo triggers a "Lucky Strike" and increases the region's Prismatic energy, there is a 0.6% Chance to trigger a Prismana Flow, Bonding a Prismana Form Aniimo to appear in this region.
3. Every weekend, the abundant Vein energy will also Bonding large numbers of Aniimo to gather and appear in the currently designated Area, where Pathfinders can head out to explore and Catch them.
4. During the Event, some special Prismana Form Aniimo will also be drawn by Vein energy and appear for a limited time in designated Areas. Please refer to the Event preview below for the Prismana Forms appearing in each phase and their corresponding Areas.
