2. During the Event, for the first 3 "Nurture Ecology" attempts each weekend in the currently designated Area, the Chance of Nova Stage Aniimo appearing will be greatly increased. After harvesting Veinfruit, the amount of Area Prismana gained will also receive an additional 50% increase.
"Nurture Ecology" increases the current Area's Prismana. When Catching Aniimo, there is also a Chance to trigger a Lucky Strike, which increases the Area's Prismana.
·Each time "Nurture Ecology" increases an Area's Prismana, there is a 3% Chance to trigger a Prismana Flow, Bonding a Prismana Form Aniimo to appear in that Area.
·Each time Catching Aniimo triggers a "Lucky Strike" and increases an Area's Prismana, there is a 0.6% Chance to trigger a Prismana Flow, Bonding a Prismana Form Aniimo to appear in that Area.
3. Each weekend, the abundant Vein energy will also Bonding large numbers of Aniimo to gather in the currently designated Area, where Pathfinders can explore and Catch them.
4. During the Event, some special Prismana Form Aniimo will also be drawn by Vein energy and appear for a limited time in designated Areas. For the Prismana Forms appearing in each phase and their corresponding Areas, please refer to the Event preview below.
