<link="item_10400011"><color=#5090df><u>Crackle Power Pole</u></color></link> placement limit increased.You come across a fragrant Emberpup, a companion of the Bloomville perfumer Ranka. Ranka dreams of crafting a legendary perfume that requires the flower of a ridgeback tree, but the tree hasn’t flowered in years, and he’s been lying around dejected ever since. The Emberpup travels all this way hoping to make the tree bloom again and lift its friend’s spirits.You hand the Shell Sword to the Sparkling Shelly, who promises to keep it safe forever, even after it becomes a true knight with a sword of its own. You agree to meet again once it has evolved into a Sherro.BuffTucking must have set up obstacles to keep villains from reaching the Sanctum. I hope you can overcome the challenges along the way and find the end!The gathering venue is looking perfect now!
But of course, a harvest festival needs a proper feast.
