This is the most genius invention of Astra—the <style=Hint_BgD>Mini World-Class RV</style>, the <style=Hint_BgD>GoGoHomes</style>!The Battle Art Department was founded to strengthen physical training and prepare for wilderness crises. Using holographic simulation technology, it focuses on improving how humans and Aniimo fight together and honing exceptional combat skills.Has a chance to be obtained when catching Aniimo of the same family(1) This game is a role-playing game suitable for users aged 12 and above. It is recommended that minors use the game product under the supervision of their parents.
(2) This game is based on a fictional lore as the background. It tells the story of the player building friendships with fictional creatures in the world and going on adventures together in the new world. The storyline is simple and positive, without any adaptation based on real history or the real world. The scenes are colorful, and the music is lively. Players play as human protagonists in the game, with gameplay based on a certain level of physical operation and intellectual judgment. The game encourages players to achieve their goals through thinking and training, and there is a social system based on text and voice in the game.
(3) This game has a user real-name authentication system. Users who are authenticated as minors will be subject to the following management: minor users can only log in to the game from 20:00 to 21:00 on Fridays, Saturdays, Sundays, and legal holidays, and are not allowed to play the game at other times.
(4) This game focuses on adventure and training, which can cultivate players’ imagination and love for nature. In the game, each player can form deep friendships with adorable fictional creatures, embark on a journey of growth together, and explore unknown territories. In this process, players will not only experience various adventures but also enjoy the joy of teamwork. The game design can bring optimistic and positive emotional responses to players, guide them to form positive emotional expressions, and obtain a relaxed and comfortable emotional experience.One last line!Chemistry QuizI heard your Aniimo is very strongSilver Helm Visor<style=Hint_BgL>A temporary item for use in the current match only. It cannot be extracted. </style>
