Research Day 50
Notes by: Perfumer Ampah · Florifragrant School
Mood: Pleased
Activities: We’ve discovered that telling stories to the miraculous seedling encourages growth.
Results: The miraculous seedling seems to grow faster when it listens to happy stories.
Notes: A couple from Azureville arrived unexpectedly and were attracted by our perfume techniques. They have decided to remain for now. I have high hopes for Joss in particular, but he seems more interested in the Blended Fragrance School. I’m going to see if I can convince Marissa.Increases Aniimo HP cap. Aniimo with 0 HP won’t be able to fight.I don’t want to end up like them... For us, losing our fighting spirit means losing everything.Just like before! The fragrance summoned Aeolus again!Hide EcsTopLogo(Translator) Huu! The next patrol point is over there. Let’s go!Some strange tracks are showing under the light. Follow the tracks and see what you can find.Bronze FigureHouseAnyway, thank you for being part of the experience. I’ve noted down many ideas for improvements.Aniimo should be on fire—no, I mean fired up! Check this out!Duskwhispers symbolize waiting and longing. They have been living on this land for thousands of years, and even Bloomville was born in their gentle embrace.A peculiar rock containing the power of Metal Element.
It’s incredibly hard and won’t break even under heavy pressure, making it the ideal material for crafting forging tools.This shows that the Idyll Civilization at that time had already mastered the technology to create magic devices...
