Today is the first day of our acquaintance. By "we," I don’t mean me and another person, but me and this notebook.
Starting today, this notebook will be my diary. As the saying goes, "Paper is more patient than people." It will witness every feeling I experience and every story I tell, sharing them with me along the way.

June 29
I have to admit, having a diary to confide in feels wonderful.
Today, I saw Iola. I wanted so badly to walk up to her and tell her how I feel,
but I don’t want to hear her turn me down.
So for now, I’ll just watch her from afar.Listen to yourself, that’s too outdated! At the very least, it should be quantum fraud... No, I’m definitely not a scammer.Recommended Quick RestockMap Unlock Dialogue for DrawingChromaflare peonies have massive clusters of petals in riotous colors, each bloom shimmering with an inner radiance.{0} can only be performed in person.You made Nimbi happy! That’s why big one got better!To collect every Prismana Aniimo!A finely crafted vessel fired at high temperatures, with a hard, dense body, a smooth glaze, and an elegant, understated finish.Moondew AromathystBeautiful... like a flame that never fades. Just as I remember! Ah—showing my age there...
