 Level 5, <style=Q_4>Purple</style>-quality up to Level 10, and <style=Q_5>Gold</style>-quality up to Level 15.+Restores <style=Hint_BgL><customRichText(calcData,buff,20320001,param2,1,%d)>%</style> max HP every <style=Hint_BgL><customRichText(calcData,buff,20320001,param3,1)></style>s. When receiving healing, fires <style=Hint_BgL><customRichText(calcData,buff,2032000,param3,1)></style> pulses at the nearest target, dealing True Damage equal to <style=Hint_BgL><customRichText(calcData,buff,2032000,param6,1,%d)>%</style> of healing received plus <style=Hint_BgL><customRichText(calcData,buff,2032000,param13,1,%d)>%</style> of max HP. The pulse ricochets up to <style=Hint_BgL><customRichText(calcData,buff,2032000,param9,1)></style> times. If there is only one target, it can ricochet between the target and the player.Complete 5 Aniimo trips at the Park.Use to learn how to craft <style=Hint_BgL>Umbral Pickle</style>.(Translator) Wuum! Shelly will fight bravely...!Advanced GizmoDream Spark ExchangeCatch a total of 50 Aniimo from the Reefish, Popapus, or Bubbeep families.I snuck out—went looking for a Flameruff on patrol with its pack. Didn’t expect Grace to follow... She was terrified when she saw it, yappir!Congratulations! You completed the tutorial! Now move to the finish gate.Feature under maintenance.But to satisfy that picky queen... ordinary truffles won’t do, right?Keep PlayingBut— Lady Velouria, Bloomville—Everything’s sold out. Thanks for your support!I can’t solve the cave puzzle.We are the Windgliders!Dread Base 1RV Level 3Fires <style=Hint_BgL>5</style> homing stars. Each time a star damages a target, the user gains a <style=Hint_BgL><customRichText(calcData,buff,210120400,param0,1,%d)>%</style> Damage Boost, stacking up to <style=Hint_BgL>20</style> times.Character disconnectedAwen finally understands why her scent is different from everyone else’s: her ancestors came from Azureville, but a great upheaval a century ago prevented them from ever returning. Sh