ore.Patrol togetherDamage Interval (sec)The Tromber in the RainDon’t forget to greet other Pathfinders you meet using <style=Hint_BgL>Interaction Panel</style>!I’m beat. Gonna rest for a bit!You can switch Active Skills in the Pathfinder <style=Hint_BgL>Skill Setup</style> interface. Here, you can set up both combat skill sets and Mobility skill sets. Combat skill sets are used in battle, while Mobility skill sets are used out of battle.Where could the Pranky from five years ago be now?Moody CapI'll always be there for you...Open your Profile to <link="appearHelp_805"><color=#5090df><u>Exchange Aniimo</u></color></link> with friends.Not enough space here. Action failed.Detective PanacheI’m technically in charge, but AI handles almost everything.Teams land at different <style=Hint_BgL>landing points</style> across the island. Gather as many supplies and eggs as you can, then make your way to your Egg Boat on the <style=Hint_BgL>other side of the map</style> to evacuate!Placeholder text content placeholder text content placeholder text content placeholder text content placeholder text content placeholder text content placeholder text contentDestructible Stone Aniipod_Lv4_Destruction Count 3 LargeFacilities can be upgraded to Lv.{1} once the RV reaches Lv.{0}.Are you a...human?Hide from StrangersUh, don’t ask how I know... I just do!See how incredible Inferlupa is? No wonder it’s called the legend of Beast Fang Ridge.
