Available from the Advanced Companion Handbook.Each time a Bloom releases Prismatic Energy, there’s a chance a Prismana Aniimo will appear!Its electric current... It would hear what I’m really saying.What do you know? Big fluffy Nimbi are so much more comfortable to hug. Lady Irelia will definitely prefer my Nimbi.Lead the danceIn-game payment is not supported during this test. Please visit the official website for more information.Why are you out here?Follow me!Pale Grain - Skyblue Low Brick WallOption Name Placeholder Option Name PlaceholderStarry was a special Celestis—intelligent and with a profound love for food. With the help of Twinkle, they would steal large starines that were too tough for other Celestises to bite into. Together, they would use sharpened rocks to cut open the large Starines and eat the extra delicious pulp inside. One day, they discovered a large pinkish-blue starine. Starry managed to eat its pulp and evolved into a Prismana Form Stellarys. With the newfound knowledge of Stellaryses, Starry came to understand that the magical power it possessed had made it impossible for it to stay with other Celestises. Its mind became mystical and calm, yet saying goodbye was just too hard. So, it decided to protect the Celestis outpost with its power. Later, when Twinkle started looking for large starines to meet Starry again, Starry decided to have a shower of starines to say goodbye. Sharing the large starines and their blessings with everyone.The Elder of Time IslandI received an order for adventure suits requiring heat insulation and scorch resistance. The materials must be flawless.Time StopLooks like the mask fragments here have already been recovered for Morphling, and the stone has weathered away...GraphicsDelete this photo?Light the fragrance, and with that, we enter Lumenfly Valley! Dancing in a dream that is both ethereal and illusory...
