and wings bear you across the gorge.It’s an <style=Hint_BgD>Aniimo egg</style>. I found it nearby after the last Sherro returned to the stars.The concert begins.Unlocks Emote - SmirkGo ahead, the chest is all yours!Throws a flaming pinecone that bursts on impact, scattering an additional <style=Hint_BgL>3</style> pinecone fragments in all directions. Targets hit are marked with <style=Hint_BgL>[Pinecone]</style>.14~20Some of the others said they spotted you on Beast Fang Ridge. I’ve got a favor to ask—come back to the Outpost when you can. (Keep it quiet—the Icho wants to see you.)Night Owl ChampionAfter using Nurture in any event area, catch {0}/10 Aniimo.Switching to a higher-grade Aniipod can improve your catch chance.Successfully litSimple Holo LottoEquip the exclusive contract Held Item to activate enhancement effects.Intermediate Unit ChipThere’s nothing to eat here, so I’m going back!Alright! Found the owner—time to go race! Smell ya later!Scorching Rock Cavern BonfireGet out of here while you can. Come properly prepared next time, or you’ll end up like me...Stand close to the ice, press #kHud/SkillE#z to cast a <style=Hint_BgL>Fire</style> skill to <style=Hint_BgL>melt</style> the ice in your way and get to the next objective.I want to explore more, Polaris Institute is so big!Toy shop ownerOrangeCelestis Research Report IIIA cushion for decorating your Home.Ah, #playerName#! I’ve been wanting to meet you!Hey, friendo, I’ve got a few handy tips for you...That’s rough—you just got back, and you’re heading out again already.Sparkling Type IXSenior Xiaochen...? Are you here?You seem anxious—have you lost something important?Large Bouncing Mushroom (3-Leaf)Rose Coast BonfireIncreases Lightning damage dealt by <customRichText(calcData,buff, 9147404,param0,1,%d)>%.Dream SparkNurture x1Upgrade your RV to <style=Hint_BgL>Level 12</style> and unlock the RV <style=Hint_BgL>Electric Module</style> to switch certain Home facilities to E-Mode.Tip: Try progressing the clue "Shhh!" first. Press here for a quick look.Power of Nature[Apex] Stamina consumption reduced by 10%My great-grandfather was a musician. In the era when the world lost its color, he inspired people with music.
But music that heals the soul cannot defeat hunger.
He collapsed.
He only came around after a perfumer fed him sweet nectar.
Later, unable to refuse her request, he inherited her legacy and became a perfumer himself.
He felt trapped in a place without wind.
...
Long after, he decided he had had enough and ran all the way to a cliff.
Back then, Argent Strait was still colorless, untouched by the Guardian’s grace like Bloomville.
Crescendo Cliff was ravaged by endless gales, and was known as the "Deadland of a Thousand Winds."
Yet in this deadland, my great-grandfather met some Chirpis singing in the wind.
So they sang loudly together... Even the wind couldn’t take their souls.
They were free.
They sang of freedom.
...
Years later, the Guardian returned green to the land, and Argent Strait revived.
On Crescendo Cliff, my great-grandfather twined with a Chirpi, flying and singing in the fresh wind.
This song gave birth to the Bell of Freedom.
It brought freedom, and a great wind leading to distant places.
...
My great-grandfather passed the perfumer’s legacy to my grandmother.
He was truly free.
They say he rode the great wind to where he wanted to go.
I envy him.
...
If only Flutternyms could fly across the sea.
My partner and I have always thought so.
If only there was a great wind leading far away.
I think, riding that wind, we could find freedom.
...
