Soon after, Armand returned to Bloomville to tell his tale of discovery in Beardow Woods.
All who heard his tale were excited about the miraculous seedling.
Especially the perfumers, who wanted to ride the long winds of Aeolus directly to the Beardow Woods and see the miraculous seedling for themselves.
...
The perfumers, fragrant, singing, arrived at the Beardow Woods in high spirits.
They built a towering perfume workshop near the miraculous seedling, and fragrance wafted from the tower.
With the perfumers’ care and nurturing, the miraculous seedling grew amazingly well.
Incredibly, contact with the miraculous seedling’s vines allowed a Budsquire to learn the power of [Thorn].
The Thornblade swore fealty to Princess Melloblum.
A beautiful sentiment and a pure bond were formed.
...
Soon, Princess Melloblum had seven powerful Thornblades in her service.
Yes, not six, but seven Thornblades.
These powerful Aniimo could even fight off the fearsome Grizbo, and became renowned thenceforth in the Budsquire Family as the Seven Lethal Thorns.Research NerdA warrior lies within. One who faced the strong despite fear, who found courage in weakness.Out-of-Combat Energy Recovery PercentageThank you. It’s odd that a Nimbi would name itself Lightening. Normally Nimbis are afraid of lightning. Baa...30/Don’t forget to <style=Hint_BgD>pick up</style> the finished product.Help till the soil at friends’ Homes <style=Hint_BgD>15</style> times to receive a Tilling Chest. You can open <style=Hint_BgD>1</style> per day.Tears within create the hardest thorns, but only happiness gives flowers the strength to endure the storm.Truffles, that big thing, dense woods... this forest really does hold a strange kind of life.Randomly obtain 1 Holo-gizmo.Hmm... You already know what <style=Hint_BgD>Held Items</style> are.Anyway, moving on, I plan to be Snowy’s teacher. Maybe she can learn to make perfume too!No! I’m going first. You go back!And you, Liriel—you didn’t make the same mistake, but your performance after twining was lacking. You need to strengthen your bond with your Aniimo.Sigh, I really don't know how others managed to snag one. EggsThe flying snowflakes are the wake of that speeding shadow.Hey! That wasn’t even an option!Lightchaser Through the WoodsBroadleaf ShrubsGreat! I’m sure you can find Echobacks!Correct. You can buy advanced Aniipods from shops and stores.
