Adventure Badges are a mark of honor that record a Pathfinder’s exploration achievements, training results, and chance encounters.
All Badges are reviewed and certified by Polaris Institute before being awarded.
Collect Badges to unlock <style=Hint_BgL>exclusive titles</style> and various <style=Hint_BgL>adventure privileges</style>.Recipe Note: Umbral PickleX100Choose an Outing AreaAniimo currently in your Home cannot be released.The second one went to the <style=Hint_BgD>Mushroom Chamber on the first floor</style>, where <style=Hint_BgD>light</style> shines in. The third one went to the <style=Hint_BgD>castle outskirts</style>. If you run into them, call them back~Return to Your WorldYou notice that some parts of the flower fields are brimming with energy, while others are drained and gray. Sunia recounts the legend of the Vein’s collapse and colorlessness a century ago—the land and its children lost their color and grew weak, until the Irisalis Irelia appeared and restored the earth. The Bloom Festival became an expression of gratitude to her, which is why its failure has left the people of Bloomville so worried.Damage dealt +<customRichText(calcData,buff,6003012,param0,1,%d)>% under Heavy Load.Training of Water - EasyI’ve tried extracting its scent before.
